    "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Add tests and wait-timeout by @arjundashrath in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/67\r\n* Update README by @varunsh-coder in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/52\r\n* Bump minimatch from 3.0.4 to 3.1.2 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/55\r\n* Bump decode-uri-component from 0.2.0 to 0.2.2 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/54\r\n* Bump ossf/scorecard-action from 2.0.6 to 2.1.2 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/73\r\n* Bump actions/upload-artifact from 3.1.1 to 3.1.2 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/77\r\n* Bump github/codeql-action from 2.1.35 to 2.1.37 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/64\r\n* Bump @vercel/ncc from 0.34.0 to 0.36.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/66\r\n* Bump jest-junit from 12.3.0 to 15.0.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/44\r\n* Bump json5 from 2.2.0 to 2.2.3 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/78\r\n* Bump actions/checkout from 3.1.0 to 3.3.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/76\r\n* Bump typescript from 4.9.3 to 4.9.4 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/65\r\n* Bump @types/node from 18.11.10 to 18.11.18 by @dependabot in https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/pull/74\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/step-security/wait-for-secrets/compare/v1...v1.1.0",
